-- desc:	RECOMMENDED (optional) audit-log indexes -- NOT part of the base seed.
--          create.log/all.sql does NOT include this file, so the seed stays flat. Apply ON DEMAND
--          (@create.log/recommended.pfi) where audit time-range queries matter at scale:
--          one btree index per *_log table on its *_ACTION_TS column (range scans by action time).
--
-- 06/21/2026 mir0n v1.2.9 created: per-*_log *_ACTION_TS indexes, kept out of the base seed (optional overlay)
-- 08/11/2026 mir0n v1.2.12 BIL_ACTION_TS_I removed with the bank-info log table
-----------------------------------

